/F2 10 Tf
(Background) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj
T*
(OrderCore customer keys \(CUSTOMER_ID\) are CHAR\(9\), format AAA999999) Tj
T*
(\(3 alpha + 6 digits\). Following the Northfield Distribution merger the) Tj
T*
(combined customer base exhausts the 6-digit space in Q4 2026.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 10 Tf
(Requirement R1  expand CUSTOMER_ID to CHAR\(12\)) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj
T*
(New format: AAA999999999 \(3 alpha + 9 digits, length 12\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Scope: every artifact that stores, validates, formats, slices, or) Tj
T*
(transmits the customer key must be identified and updated. This) Tj
T*
(includes, at minimum: database schemas and views, shared record) Tj
T*
(layouts, service logic, API contracts, batch jobs, partner feed) Tj
T*
(specifications, operational documentation, and tests.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Transition rule: during the transition, ids of BOTH formats are valid) Tj
T*
(input \(AAA999999 and AAA999999999\). Stored fixed-width records use the) Tj
T*
(new 12-character field width; legacy 9-character ids are right-padded) Tj
T*
(with spaces. Downstream field offsets shift accordingly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Data extracts in data/ must be migrated to the new record widths. A) Tj
T*
(one-time migration script \(fixtures/order-app/scripts/\) is in scope;) Tj
T*
(production data migration will be executed by ops at release using it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
