T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj
T*
(Add endpoint: GET /orders/{orderNo}/status) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Response body \(JSON\):) Tj
T*
({ "orderNo": string, "customerId": string, "status": string,) Tj
T*
(  "statusName": string, "statusDate": string \(YYYYMMDD\) }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
